  m_text: 'Women''s World Cup - 1999



    Pictured here is another Women''s World
    Cup, located in the Rose Bowl Stadium, in California, where the Women''s US team
    took on China''s Women''s team. Due to the growing popularity of the US Women''s
    team, FIFA realized the growing interest and moved the World Cup from a smaller
    area to the Rose Bowl Stadium where 90,185 viewers and 40 million tuned in to
    watch the US Women''s team take home the World Cup.'
