  m_text: 'Billie Jean King



    Pictured here is Billie Jean King who is the former
    world No. 1 tennis player who won 39 grand slam titles. She competed between
    1966-1975, and in 1973, she beat her male tennis opponent in a famous tennis
    match. Proving to the world that women can beat men, she pursued to fight for
    gender equality through establishing the Women''s Sports Foundation in 1974 and
    cofounding the Women''s Tennis Association. '
