  m_text: 'First Intercollegiate Basketball Game - 1896



    Pictured here is Stanford''s
    women''s basketball team that participated in the first-ever basketball game
    with female players. Between Cal and Stanford, Stanford took the win, however,
    in 3 years the universities ban women''s basketball.

